    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Zythaar",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Known in his times as the mightiest of all adepts of the black art, this lord was slain by the inquisitor Vorgel who ended his reign of terror. He is now resurrected as an undead with the intention to subjugate every mortal to his will.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thorne",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A veteran in the struggle to reclaim Elven glory, nobody enters the forest without his knowledge.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Pradesh",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237UN0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thorne",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237UN0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug Guard",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug Guard \n\u0022You expect to stroll right through our domain unchallenged?!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Begin Elf",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer  \n\u0022Illumielle! Are you well, do you require that we stay behind to protect you? The Elves that were once here cannot be found. Only brimstone and ash is all that is here!\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Illumielle \n\u0022Thank you for your concern. We have been through a great ordeal. I am as well as can be expected. I do not need further protection, I have rested and for the time being I am at full strength. Investigate and find those Elves!\u0022 \n\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022Very well! I shall do as you say! From the looks of the realm! I suspect that we will be encountering the Legions Of The Damned anytime now! The Alliance shall be ready.\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Begin Undead",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashgan \n\u0022Miserable Elves! For too long great Mortis has allowed them to live a tortured life. I shall see to it that they are destroyed forever!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ghost \n\u0022My master! I shall find it a great pleasure to decimate the Elven Alliance. I have one question. There are whispers! Stories if you will that the native Elves left on their own. The Legions merely entered and conquered and empty realm!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ashgan \n\u0022I care not for the whispers and the stories that float in your head. I am Ashgan, I have toppled civilizations! This realm will be ours! The Elven Alliance will be crushed and the Legions Of The Damned will soon follow. Death to all!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 11 Dark Elf Message",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Duke \n\u0022The Legions Of The Damned will never fall! After butchering the Forest Liege who resided here we have taken this territory for our own!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Near Ruin Spell",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elf \n\u0022You have made your last mistake! With the dark lord watching over us we shall be invincible.\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Your words are hollow at best!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 11 Elf Reply",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ruthllak \n\u0022Those disgusting Dark Elves! They are trying to bring the abomination back - they are trying to revive Gallean\u0027s Beast!\u0022 \r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Oracle \n\u0022They must be stopped, Ruthllak! Gallean would not want this!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Ruthllak \n\u0022It will be done! We must destroy all  the Dark Elves in the region! The Greenskins will fall soon after...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "T 11 Undead reply",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Shr\u0027ullen \n\u0022Gallean\u0027s Beast?!? How dare they worship such a thing? Betraying Mortis for Gallean\u0027s crumbs\u2026\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vampire \n\u0022What must be done, Shr\u0027ullen?\u0022\r \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Shr\u0027ullen \n\u0022Mortis wants them destroyed. What are you waiting for? Begone!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV0009",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Vampire \n\u0022Yes, Shr\u0027ullen...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV000a",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Black Out ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elves",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV000c",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elf Lyf \n\u0022This realm shall be the first of many to fall. Let the sacrifices begin tonight!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elves Appear",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Dark Elf Lyf \n\u0022The age of the Dark Elves is upon us. All hail our dark lord who watches over us!\u0022 \n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV000d",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "The Dark Elves have invaded the realm with the intention of sacrificing everyone in the name of their dark lord. Protect the cities from the Dark Elves. ",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S237SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S237EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Demonologist Appears",
